# LOCKED CALENDAR MODULE — DO NOT MODIFY WITHOUT EXPLICIT USER APPROVAL

The Calendar module is an approved, frozen baseline (premium cinematic crystal-glass ERP calendar). Do not change, redesign, restyle, restyle-via-globals, add, remove, resize, or reposition anything in it unless the user explicitly requests that specific Calendar change in the current conversation.

This lock is independent of the Login Page lock, the Dashboard lock, and the Clients Management lock. All four remain fully in force.

## Before editing any file below

Require an explicit user instruction that clearly asks to modify Calendar (for example: “change the Calendar icons” or “update the Calendar KPI cards”). Unrelated work, other modules, refactors, “while we’re here” polish, and inferred improvements are not approval.

